1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,670
May you one day find true love.

2
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:08,510
That is the very wish that lives
within that ring of yours.

3
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:10,590
I should find true love?

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,010
Exactly.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,600
And it's our job
to make sure we find it.

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,140
That's why, Lara,
you're going to set out

7
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,520
to the open sea from now on.

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,100
Would you like to see
a special place

9
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:23,020
that we haven't told
anybody about?

10
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:25,570
We can take you there.
When you see the moon

11
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,610
from the secret spot,
it looks huge.

12
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,990
Everyone's so happy...

13
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,620
because you have become
one of the princesses.

14
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,790
Is there somewhere
that you'd like to go to, Lara?

15
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,710
I guess I shouldn't say this,

16
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:45,340
but I'd really like to see
the human world.

17
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,720
[♪ calm music]

18
00:00:56,350 --> 00:00:58,560
[♪ opening music begins]

19
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:25,350
[♪ opening music ends]

20
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,730
[birds chirping]

21
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,480
[groans softly]

22
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,620
[alarm] Wake up, it's 6 AM.

23
00:02:38,830 --> 00:02:40,740
Time for your
early morning workout.

24
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,540
What?

25
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:48,460
Huh?

26
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,090
Lex, what is happening?

27
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,510
All right,
let me think about this.

28
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:01,720
Somehow I came back to life,

29
00:03:02,970 --> 00:03:04,520
and I heard a voice calling me.

30
00:03:05,270 --> 00:03:06,230
[gasps]

31
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:08,730
[♪ mysterious music]

32
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,360
Oh, I remember now.

33
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:17,530
That was the potion that turns
mermaids into humans.

34
00:03:18,570 --> 00:03:21,200
The next thing I remember,
I was hit by...

35
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:23,620
that human who's terrifying!

36
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,370
I heard that Lady Witch

37
00:03:26,410 --> 00:03:28,040
has many servants
under her control.

38
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:31,040
Was that one of them?
Does that mean she tricked me?

39
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:34,170
Lady Witch must have
captured me, and now-—

40
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,470
[alarm]

41
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:38,010
Time for your
early morning workout.

42
00:03:38,050 --> 00:03:39,180
Time for your early mo-—

43
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:40,300
[glass shatters]

44
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,190
Huh?

45
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:49,350
[♪ upbeat music]

46
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:54,320
-What is this world?
-Care to explain yourself?

47
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:11,210
[yells]

48
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:19,510
[panting]

49
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,720
What should I do?

50
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:28,060
I have to hide somewhere.

51
00:04:28,690 --> 00:04:31,020
[helicopter whirring]

52
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,570
Oh, that's-—

53
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,280
This building
is the biggest church

54
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,950
we have in this entire country.

55
00:04:39,610 --> 00:04:42,200
It's the closest place
to God's love and protection.

56
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:45,040
[♪ upbeat music continues]

57
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:52,540
Lara, I still love you.

58
00:04:57,590 --> 00:04:58,710
Oh, Father.

59
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,130
[door creaks]

60
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:05,010
[♪ ominous music]

61
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,270
[screaming]

62
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:10,560
No! Don't come any closer!

63
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,520
Keep away!

64
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:15,480
Um, I'm a princess
of the royal family!

65
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,190
[WOMAN] Lara.

66
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,740
That's Lady Witch's voice.

67
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,490
Where is it coming from?

68
00:05:23,570 --> 00:05:24,620
Lara?

69
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:27,240
Hey, Lara.

70
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,080
I'm down here.

71
00:05:31,250 --> 00:05:34,290
Huh? Why does that fish
sound like Lady Witch?

72
00:05:34,330 --> 00:05:35,960
It's probably because it is me.

73
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,050
Hey.

74
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:38,500
Just who are you?

75
00:05:38,550 --> 00:05:40,630
My bedroom window, my room...

76
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:42,720
are both a total mess.

77
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:45,340
What are you going to do
about that?

78
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,390
[WITCH] Lara!

79
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:48,140
You threw away
my Haddo too.

80
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:50,560
-Can you hear me?
-What if it breaks?

81
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,390
-Pay attention.
-Are you listening?

82
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:54,350
-What are you going to do?
-Can you hear me?

83
00:05:54,390 --> 00:05:55,520
-Answer me!
-Lara!

84
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:57,610
Mari, dinner.

85
00:05:58,940 --> 00:05:59,780
[thud]

86
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,440
Dad...

87
00:06:02,490 --> 00:06:04,610
[♪ upbeat music]

88
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:10,000
Grandma, I'm staying
at a friend's tonight.

89
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:12,250
-Which friend?
-It's fine, right?

90
00:06:12,290 --> 00:06:14,290
It's not fine.
Who is this friend?

91
00:06:14,330 --> 00:06:16,670
-It's okay, isn't it?
-What's okay about it?

92
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:19,460
Mari, isn't your friend
going to eat?

93
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,880
Oh, that's right.
Mari has a friend.

94
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:24,590
This is the first time
I see one of your friends.

95
00:06:25,050 --> 00:06:26,590
Did you say Mari's friend?

96
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:29,060
Mari actually made a friend.

97
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,600
You do know I talk
to Gon-chan as well.

98
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:33,810
You idiot.
You know fish don't talk.

99
00:06:33,850 --> 00:06:36,650
-But I went to all this trouble.
-It's okay, I'll eat it.

100
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:41,990
[WITCH] So then, I see
you've accepted those legs.

101
00:06:42,030 --> 00:06:43,280
My little gift to you.

102
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,860
Is it true?

103
00:06:45,910 --> 00:06:47,740
I need to know,
are you really Lady Witch?

104
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,280
Yes, I am.

105
00:06:49,410 --> 00:06:51,290
It's been a while, Lara.

106
00:06:59,170 --> 00:07:00,420
But I don't understand.

107
00:07:02,300 --> 00:07:04,800
What happened to you?
You're now a small fish!

108
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,430
How observant.

109
00:07:06,470 --> 00:07:08,470
Also, what was everything I saw
in those mirrors?

110
00:07:08,850 --> 00:07:09,970
It's all true.

111
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:13,230
Where we are is now a place
called Shiga.

112
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:18,060
The mermaids lost their castle,
so I led them all the way here.

113
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,980
To this wonderful land.

114
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:23,690
However, it made no difference
what I did.

115
00:07:24,150 --> 00:07:26,240
Their light continued
to fade away.

116
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:28,950
The citizens, the royal family,
and Rowan...

117
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,490
they're all in a deep sleep
in my mansion right now.

118
00:07:33,330 --> 00:07:36,370
Well, I suppose they may as well
be dead, if I'm brutally honest.

119
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:39,000
Lara, it's all your fault.

120
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,080
[gasps]

121
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:42,250
You shouldn't act too surprised.

122
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:44,630
They lost their light because
you broke the law.

123
00:07:45,130 --> 00:07:47,300
To think this all happened
because you decided

124
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:50,300
to fall in love with some
measly human being.

125
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:54,390
It's because of me? Father...

126
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:57,940
The castle...
has lost its light.

127
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,270
That's right.

128
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,810
Although I remember
what you said,

129
00:08:02,150 --> 00:08:04,150
that it's possible
I could find a way

130
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,610
to bring my family back to life.

131
00:08:06,490 --> 00:08:08,240
[WITCH] If the light
is ever lost,

132
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,030
just find a way to get it back.

133
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:15,000
You must go
and find true love, Lara.

134
00:08:15,250 --> 00:08:17,540
You are a princess.

135
00:08:18,250 --> 00:08:19,250
[gasps]

136
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,040
It's dark.

137
00:08:29,380 --> 00:08:31,430
Successfully connected
to Wi-Fi.

138
00:08:32,050 --> 00:08:33,260
[MARI] Thank goodness...

139
00:08:34,050 --> 00:08:35,100
it's still working.

140
00:08:36,310 --> 00:08:38,640
You're lucky, but you've got
to pay for the window.

141
00:08:39,140 --> 00:08:41,270
[WITCH] Mari,
I'm still hungry, you know.

142
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:43,650
No way, you've been gaining
too much weight.

143
00:08:43,690 --> 00:08:46,990
-Hey, Haddo, order me some cake.
-Hey, Haddo, cancel that.

144
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:48,610
-Hey!
-What?

145
00:08:48,650 --> 00:08:50,450
You know what happens
if I don't get my way.

146
00:08:50,490 --> 00:08:52,450
-Wow, I'm so scared.
-I can't.

147
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:55,490
There's nothing
I can do about it anymore.

148
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,250
[WITCH] Hmph,
so you're giving up then?

149
00:08:59,210 --> 00:09:01,330
You've lost your castle,
your family is gone.

150
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,460
And yet you are the only one
who can save them.

151
00:09:05,250 --> 00:09:07,250
You know,
you're really chatty today.

152
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:09,470
[sobs]

153
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:13,350
Why are you making her cry,
Gon-chan?

154
00:09:13,390 --> 00:09:15,100
All I did
was tell her the truth.

155
00:09:15,470 --> 00:09:17,390
You really don't have
any tact, do you?

156
00:09:17,970 --> 00:09:19,980
That's who I am.
What's wrong with that?

157
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,520
She feels attacked by you.

158
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:23,690
It's not my fault
she's a crybaby.

159
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:25,020
My ring!

160
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:27,150
Where is my royal ring?

161
00:09:28,570 --> 00:09:31,320
[MARI] Your ring?
Did you lose it?

162
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:34,530
Whatever, forget about it.
You don't need it.

163
00:09:34,990 --> 00:09:36,030
[gasps]

164
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:42,210
[WITCH] Lara,
where are you going?

165
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,670
Hey, Mari, chase after her!

166
00:09:45,290 --> 00:09:47,500
-Why though?
-Just do it already.

167
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,670
Later. I've got to get
to practice soon.

168
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:53,260
[WITCH] Hey,
you have to listen to me!

169
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:55,100
Please, Mari!

170
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:58,430
She has the potential to bring
Shiga Town down!

171
00:09:58,470 --> 00:09:59,680
She's a princess!

172
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:06,610
Yeah, she's a princess.
So what?

173
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,360
[WITCH] Hey, Mari!

174
00:10:14,570 --> 00:10:17,370
I'll get it back,
whatever it takes.

175
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:27,670
Good to see you.

176
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:30,250
It has been a while
since you've been here.

177
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:33,510
-What brings you to town today?
-Nothing much.

178
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:37,550
I thought it would be nice
to see an old friend.

179
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:49,320
I'm so glad it's still working.

180
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,650
Lady Lisa, what's that light?

181
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:57,570
I don't know. However...

182
00:10:59,990 --> 00:11:02,160
if this ring
has resonated with it...

183
00:11:03,370 --> 00:11:04,330
Lara!

184
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,910
[dogs barking]

185
00:11:06,660 --> 00:11:09,380
Shiro!
What's wrong with you, Shiro?!

186
00:11:24,230 --> 00:11:27,390
Shiga, what a terrifying place
this is.

187
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,150
Huh?

188
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:41,740
The area where I lost
my important ring...

189
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,120
Just where is that place?

190
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,370
What are you doing there?

191
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,130
Are you a customer?

192
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:51,130
You don't look like one.

193
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,460
What's up with this girl?

194
00:11:53,500 --> 00:11:55,510
What's the matter, huh?

195
00:11:56,470 --> 00:11:58,340
Oh dear, I don't think
she understands.

196
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:00,220
It could be that she's lost.

197
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,220
Maybe we should drive her
to the station.

198
00:12:02,470 --> 00:12:03,560
Oh, drive!

199
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:05,520
[horse galloping]

200
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,980
Should we stop at a police box
and ask?

201
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:12,980
I wonder what's up with her.
There's a scar on her tongue.

202
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:15,280
Don't be silly,
you must be seeing things.

203
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:18,200
-Where are you going?
-What's she doing?

204
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:25,250
Why is this world so weird?

205
00:12:25,830 --> 00:12:28,410
I don't understand anything.
I don't know where to go.

206
00:12:31,250 --> 00:12:33,250
-Huh?
-Hi there!

207
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:35,050
We're running
a special promotion

208
00:12:35,090 --> 00:12:37,380
for new HopCard members
if you want to sign up.

209
00:12:38,090 --> 00:12:40,380
I don't understand.
What's this?

210
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:42,550
It's simple.
If you're new and you sign up,

211
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,100
we're offering up to 200 points

212
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:46,060
if you decide
to get a card today.

213
00:12:46,310 --> 00:12:47,390
Huh?

214
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,390
In order to start
your application,

215
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:53,650
please fill in your information
in the space outlined in bold.

216
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:58,530
This booklet contains all of the
HopCard terms and conditions.

217
00:12:58,570 --> 00:13:01,200
Now, regarding
your accumulated Hop points...

218
00:13:04,410 --> 00:13:06,660
I don't have any time
for this kind of thing.

219
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:20,050
[DOLL] Come and play with me

220
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:21,630
and my friends in the ocean.

221
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:26,260
Come and- come and- come and-
come and play with me

222
00:13:26,310 --> 00:13:28,220
and my friends in the ocean.

223
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,360
I just don't understand it
at all.

224
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,700
What's the deal
with this Shiga town?

225
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,290
I want to go home.

226
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:54,500
Back to... the ocean.

227
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:59,050
[bird squawking]

228
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,970
[♪ emotional music]

229
00:14:05,890 --> 00:14:07,010
Wait, isn't that...

230
00:14:08,050 --> 00:14:10,270
[panting]

231
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:20,900
My ring!

232
00:14:21,530 --> 00:14:23,820
It's there... somewhere!

233
00:14:25,070 --> 00:14:27,950
A very special and wonderfully
radiant princess.

234
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:30,700
That is exactly
what our mother was like.

235
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:34,410
Even the very light that brings
this castle to life,

236
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:36,330
it was all created by her.

237
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:41,000
And there might be a chance
that maybe one of us princesses

238
00:14:41,050 --> 00:14:44,090
has that power
that our mother once had.

239
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:45,630
Huh?

240
00:14:46,130 --> 00:14:47,090
[whimpers]

241
00:14:47,550 --> 00:14:49,560
There's no use staring
at your hands.

242
00:14:50,310 --> 00:14:52,270
It's the light
that is born out of love.

243
00:14:53,890 --> 00:14:57,150
Tell me, Lara,
have you ever felt that warm,

244
00:14:57,190 --> 00:15:00,400
tingling love somewhere deep
within your heart?

245
00:15:05,070 --> 00:15:06,990
Hmm, I'm not really getting it.

246
00:15:08,450 --> 00:15:11,160
Well, that's okay, because it's
only when a chosen princess

247
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,160
feels true love
that a radiant light

248
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,580
begins to well up
from deep within her heart.

249
00:15:17,330 --> 00:15:19,460
So then
all six of us princesses

250
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:23,090
are searching for true love
to bring that light.

251
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,880
After all, we have a mission,
and that mission

252
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:29,300
is to bring that light...
to everyone in this castle.

253
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:32,510
That's why we're all here.

254
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:36,640
No! I can't find it!

255
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,060
Why?

256
00:15:42,230 --> 00:15:43,320
Could it be?

257
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,490
I've lost my ring.

258
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,700
I've lost my family.

259
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:55,250
And now...
I've lost my home.

260
00:15:58,830 --> 00:15:59,750
What?

261
00:16:01,250 --> 00:16:02,340
My lights!

262
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:07,010
Why can't I breathe?!

263
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:11,550
I can't move.

264
00:16:17,310 --> 00:16:18,440
No!

265
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:21,480
I've even lost the sea.

266
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,730
I can't go back...

267
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:26,740
...anymore.

268
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:42,290
[Mari pants]
[Lara coughs]

269
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:50,050
Wow, it's you.

270
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:53,100
All right, what is your problem?

271
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:58,480
You just decided to walk into
Lake Biwa and start drowning?

272
00:16:58,930 --> 00:17:01,270
You're a mermaid, but what good
is that if you can drown?

273
00:17:01,310 --> 00:17:02,560
This is all your fault!

274
00:17:02,770 --> 00:17:04,520
Huh?

275
00:17:04,570 --> 00:17:06,860
If it wasn't for you,
I wouldn't have lost my ring!

276
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:09,150
Huh? You're the one
who bumped into me!

277
00:17:09,190 --> 00:17:10,610
That ring is important to me!

278
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:13,200
Well, the stuff in my room
is important too.

279
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,620
Don't forget about my window.

280
00:17:28,010 --> 00:17:30,050
[MARI] Come on, let's go.

281
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,630
[machine beeping]
[soft thud]

282
00:18:15,090 --> 00:18:16,140
[LARA] Oh!

283
00:18:28,980 --> 00:18:30,070
Huh?

284
00:18:57,180 --> 00:18:59,350
[♪ soft music]

285
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:01,270
[drinking sounds]

286
00:19:13,530 --> 00:19:14,570
Delicious.

287
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:21,290
By the way, thank you.

288
00:19:21,950 --> 00:19:24,160
-Hmm?
-For helping me.

289
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:28,250
-No biggie.
-I really am quite an idiot...

290
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:30,540
for not saying thank you.

291
00:19:31,250 --> 00:19:32,250
Even if...

292
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,010
even if you're the servant
to Lady Witch.

293
00:19:36,470 --> 00:19:38,550
[MARI] Huh? Lady Witch?

294
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:40,640
You mean Gon-chan?

295
00:19:41,470 --> 00:19:42,640
I'm not her servant.

296
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:45,140
[LARA] Huh? You're not?

297
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:48,560
[MARI] If anything,
that fish is really my pet.

298
00:19:49,020 --> 00:19:50,310
A lady witch is your pet?

299
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:53,230
Is that true?
Who on earth are you?

300
00:19:57,450 --> 00:19:58,450
My name is Mari.

301
00:19:59,870 --> 00:20:00,700
Mari Otsu.

302
00:20:06,290 --> 00:20:07,290
Mari.

303
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,170
That's a lovely name.

304
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:17,300
[♪ gentle song]

305
00:20:17,340 --> 00:20:22,600
♪ That train,
where we are coming from ♪

306
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:32,310
♪ Going to that place
we have never been ♪

307
00:20:33,110 --> 00:20:34,150
Huh?

308
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,360
-You really just found her?
-Yeah.

309
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:41,660
Gon-chan was on the verge
of death when I first saw her.

310
00:20:43,410 --> 00:20:44,950
So I made her my pet.

311
00:20:45,370 --> 00:20:46,370
[LARA] Your pet?

312
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:49,040
You do know she's
a terrifying witch, right?

313
00:20:49,540 --> 00:20:51,630
Well, right now she's just
a cute little fish.

314
00:20:52,130 --> 00:20:53,420
[LARA] You're so weird, Mari.

315
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:56,090
Yeah, well,
you're a pretty weird mermaid.

316
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,130
I'm going to sleep now.

317
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:07,350
Lady Witch, are you awake?

318
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,230
I want to apologize.

319
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:12,610
I ran away this morning...

320
00:21:13,770 --> 00:21:16,270
because I was terrified
that there would be no way

321
00:21:17,690 --> 00:21:21,650
I would ever regain the Light of
Love, especially after I died.

322
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:25,490
[witch scoffs] I could
have not gotten involved at all,

323
00:21:25,530 --> 00:21:26,490
you know?

324
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:31,540
Hey, Lady Witch,
do you think I'll find it?

325
00:21:32,540 --> 00:21:36,550
Can I find true love right
here in Shiga?

326
00:21:40,340 --> 00:21:41,380
Let's go home.

327
00:21:48,220 --> 00:21:51,100
-Hey, Lady Witch...
-Go to sleep!

328
00:21:54,270 --> 00:21:56,400
[♪ closing music begins]

329
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:23,480
[♪ closing music ends]

330
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:41,630
-Huh!
-Oh!

331
00:23:42,170 --> 00:23:43,210
[MALE] Wow.

332
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:47,220
Lady Lisa,
you said it would be like this.

333
00:23:47,630 --> 00:23:48,680
Huh?

334
00:23:49,350 --> 00:23:50,470
She's special.

335
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,810
She's the chosen princess.

336
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:57,310
I know you will find it,
my beloved Lara.

